82 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 50 0 R
/T (COLIVERA: IoT-based E. coli Detection and Monitoring System is a portable water quality monitoring system developed to detect Escherichia coli bacteria in real time through an integrated IoT workflow. The system connects hardware sensors, network communication, AI-based analysis, and a web monitoring dashboard to help stakeholders monitor potential water contamination more efficiently. This project was developed as a team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and Full Stack Developer.  I helped manage the development process and built the web-based monitoring dashboard, including data visualization, detection results, role-based access control, and sensor alert notifications. COLIVERA was successfully tested to detect E. coli in real time, registered as an Intellectual Property Right \(IPR/HKI\) trademark, and awarded as the 2nd Favorite Group at the Capstone Expo.)
/E (COLIVERA: IoT-based E. coli Detection and Monitoring System is a portable water quality monitoring system developed to detect Escherichia coli bacteria in real time through an integrated IoT workflow. The system connects hardware sensors, network communication, AI-based analysis, and a web monitoring dashboard to help stakeholders monitor potential water contamination more efficiently. This project was developed as a team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and Full Stack Developer.  I helped manage the development process and built the web-based monitoring dashboard, including data visualization, detection results, role-based access control, and sensor alert notifications. COLIVERA was successfully tested to detect E. coli in real time, registered as an Intellectual Property Right \(IPR/HKI\) trademark, and awarded as the 2nd Favorite Group at the Capstone Expo.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
