161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 51 0 R
/T (iHealth Edu  is a web-based mental health screening system developed to help local residents measure depression, anxiety, and stress levels through a simple digital assessment, especially for residents with diabetes and hypertension. This project was developed by our team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and Full Stack Developer.  I helped build the screening flow, score calculation, result display, and data management based on the DASS-21 method. The system was implemented during seminar and door-to-door activities in Banyumanik, Semarang, reaching up to 400 participants and helping facilitators review screening results more clearly.)
/E (iHealth Edu  is a web-based mental health screening system developed to help local residents measure depression, anxiety, and stress levels through a simple digital assessment, especially for residents with diabetes and hypertension. This project was developed by our team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and Full Stack Developer.  I helped build the screening flow, score calculation, result display, and data management based on the DASS-21 method. The system was implemented during seminar and door-to-door activities in Banyumanik, Semarang, reaching up to 400 participants and helping facilitators review screening results more clearly.)
