305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 53 0 R
/T (Nourish+ is a mobile app design concept created to support pregnant women and parents in accessing maternal and child health guidance through a more practical and accessible digital experience. The project focuses on nutrition awareness, pregnancy care, child health information, and emergency support for families in Indonesia. This project was developed by our team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and UI/UX Designer. I helped lead the design process using the Design Thinking method, from identifying user needs and creating user flows to designing wireframes and high-fidelity prototypes. The final prototype was recognized as 3rd Winner in a UI/UX Design Competition.)
/E (Nourish+ is a mobile app design concept created to support pregnant women and parents in accessing maternal and child health guidance through a more practical and accessible digital experience. The project focuses on nutrition awareness, pregnancy care, child health information, and emergency support for families in Indonesia. This project was developed by our team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and UI/UX Designer. I helped lead the design process using the Design Thinking method, from identifying user needs and creating user flows to designing wireframes and high-fidelity prototypes. The final prototype was recognized as 3rd Winner in a UI/UX Design Competition.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
