/Title (RacingCar 3D is my first 3D game project developed using Unity for the Multimedia course. This project became my starting point in learning game development from scratch, from understanding the Unity workspace, preparing assets, building terrain, designing racing tracks, to creating a playable racing experience. As a Solo Game Developer, I learned how to combine 3D assets, environment design, car movement, camera control, and gameplay logic into one complete game. Even though I started as a beginner with no prior Unity experience, I kept learning through trial and error until RacingCar 3D became a playable project and achieved the highest score in my cohort.)
