/Title (Dopamind+ is a mobile-based mental health application prototype designed to help adolescents manage stress, emotional pressure, daily activities, sleep quality, menstrual cycles, and access mental health support through a simple and supportive digital experience. This project was developed by our team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and UI/UX Designer. I helped lead the design process using the Design Thinking method, from user research and empathy mapping to wireframing, high-fidelity prototyping, and usability testing. The prototype received positive user feedback, with an 82% usability test result and a 4.26/5 satisfaction score, was recognized as a 1st Winner, and was also published as a journal article.)
