1934 0 obj
<<
/Title (iHealth Edu  is a web-based mental health screening system developed to help local residents measure depression, anxiety, and stress levels through a simple digital assessment, especially for residents with diabetes and hypertension. This project was developed by our team, where I contributed as the Project Manager and Full Stack Developer.  I helped build the screening flow, score calculation, result display, and data management based on the DASS-21 method. The system was implemented during seminar and door-to-door activities in Banyumanik, Semarang, reaching up to 400 participants and helping facilitators review screening results more clearly.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1921 0 R
/Prev 1933 0 R
>>
